{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792436100, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T18:55:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T18:56:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792436160, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T18:55:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17633, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北孩子不需要一週喝一瓶鮮奶（頤笑國際）我們要教室沒有老鼠， 導師不用黏鼠板，小朋友幫忙去丟掉老鼠！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.17,633", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T18:55:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16651, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "為何一堆需要封路或管制交通的措施（砍樹修樹、人行道施工封閉一側道路）都要在上下班時間施作，這不是很蠢", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.16,651", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T18:55:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20002, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "大安路不要再越改越窄了，跟仁愛路口那是什麼設計，便一線道，都被左轉堵住了", "display_name": "大安代表 No.20,002", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T18:55:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24262, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "其他", "content": "上來台北十年，總感覺台北都沒有變好，只有環境變髒變亂，就算有建設也都超醜的，活動也是為了辦而辦，可憐", "display_name": "南港代表 No.24,262", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 16651, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.16,651", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 20002, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.20,002", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 24262, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.24,262", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 60457, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_cultu